A version under history/ numbered minor with forward entries: translating
forward is implicit for a compatible change, and a tip like it does not
compile, so it was not cut so: an immutability violation naming both files.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	a: string
}
-- ship/history/0.1.thema --
Schema: {
	a:  string
	b?: int
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v0_1: {
		b: 1
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	a:  string
	b?: int
}
-- out/error --
error[E0355]: immutability violation: v0.1 has a ForwardLens, and is backward compatible with v0.0
 --> history/0.1.thema:6:1
  |
6 | ForwardLens: {
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^
  |
 ::: history/0.0.thema:1:1
  |
1 | Schema: {
  | ------ the version before it
  |
  = note: an instance of a version is already an instance of its minor successor; translating forward is implicit
  = help: run thema lineage check --published to find which file changed since it was cut, restore it, and make the change in tip.thema
